<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-06-11T00:00:00.000Z" agent="Trae"><diagram id="pipeline" name="Pipeline"><mxGraphModel dx="1800" dy="2600" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="3200" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="header" value="SciAtlas Idea Generation Pipeline&#10;Run dir: /REDACTED/tiaozhanbei/chemstry_question/01-&#10;新颜色颜料/flash&#10;Topic: Research question: Are there more color pigments to&#10;discover?&#10;Context: It is possible to create new pigments, but not&#10;new colors. The first synthetic pigment was made in the&#10;early 1700s. In 2009, chemist Mas Subramanian accidently&#10;created a new blue pigment called “YInMn Blue.”&#10;Status: ok&#10;Failed step: N/A" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="40" width="442" height="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="params" value="Input Parameters&#10;topic: Research question: Are there more color pigments to&#10;discover?&#10;Context: It is possible to create new pigments, but not&#10;new colors. The first synthetic pigment was made in the&#10;early 1700s. In 2009, chemist Mas Subramanian accidently&#10;created a new blue pigment called “YInMn Blue.”&#10;domain: Chemistry&#10;workflow_mode: flash&#10;&#10;Effective Pipeline Config&#10;workflow_mode: flash&#10;anchor_top_k: 3&#10;keyword_min_papers: 2&#10;k_step1: 1&#10;seed_num_queries: 1&#10;seed_per_query: 1&#10;seed_request_multiplier: 3&#10;seed_request_floor: 3&#10;seed_recent_years: 7&#10;seed_min_citations: 1000&#10;graph_budget_ratio: 1.0&#10;graph_budget_min: 5&#10;graph_budget_max: 5&#10;graph_max_predecessors_per_paper: 1&#10;graph_min_forward_papers: 1&#10;graph_candidate_fetch_limit: 10&#10;num_candidate_step2: 1&#10;num_expansion_step2: 1&#10;innoeval_root: /REDACTED/tiaozhanbei/SciAtlas/