cs&#10;plausible: False&#10;abstract: This work implements a generative artificial&#10;intelligence approach and a search algorithm to recreate and&#10;innovate paint formulas on a hardware-near level. We use&#10;clustering techniques to explore data latent space and then&#10;implement Markov Chain Monte Carlo techniques to sampl..." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fde9d9;strokeColor=#c55a11;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="360" y="4712" width="620" height="492" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_step6_candidates_panel" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="step_step6" target="step6_candidates_panel"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step_step7" value="Step 7 Analogy Extraction&#10;status: completed&#10;inspiration_count: 2&#10;round: 1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="5304" width="220" height="96" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_step_step6_step_step7" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=0;jettySize=0;html=0;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="step_step6" target="step_step7"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="step7_analogy_panel" value="Step 7 Analogy Results&#10;count: 2&#10;&#10;candidate_id: 1&#10;domain: same_field&#10;radius: R1&#10;title: The Serendipitous Discovery of a Rose Odorant&#10;plausible: True&#10;combination_points: ['systematic recognition of unexpected&#10;experimental outcomes', 'failure-driven discovery through&#10;analysis of routes that did not yield the intended product',&#10;'serendipity capture as a structured investigation loop']&#10;combination_plan: Augment the predictive pigment-design&#10;framework with an anomaly/serendipity loop that flags&#10;unexpected co